WEBVTT

00:00:00.541 --> 00:00:06.291
Let's drill our Egyptian walk switching our saiidi arms.

00:00:05.333 --> 00:00:15.833
Let's start with the left hand down, right hand up, weight on the right foot, weight on the ball of the left foot, knees bent and lift the hip up and down and switch.

00:00:15.208 --> 00:00:17.583
Up and down.

00:00:16.625 --> 00:00:22.000
Now make sure when you lift that hip that you're not making the hand go up and down as well.

00:00:21.041 --> 00:00:27.125
Your hip is moving in contrast to the hand and step and lift.

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:28.791
Step and lift.

00:00:27.833 --> 00:00:29.541
Step.

00:00:28.791 --> 00:00:29.916
Lift.

00:00:28.958 --> 00:00:30.708
A little faster.

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:31.166
Lift.

00:00:30.208 --> 00:00:31.791
Step.

00:00:30.833 --> 00:00:32.250
Lift.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:33.250
Step.

00:00:32.333 --> 00:00:34.041
Lift.

00:00:33.083 --> 00:00:34.666
Step.

00:00:33.708 --> 00:00:34.958
Lift.

00:00:34.333 --> 00:00:35.916
Step.

00:00:34.958 --> 00:00:36.500
Lift.

00:00:35.916 --> 00:00:37.125
Step.

00:00:36.166 --> 00:00:37.500
Lift.

00:00:36.625 --> 00:00:37.791
Slow it down again and step.

00:00:36.833 --> 00:00:40.833
Lift so you want your hands in place by the time your hip travels.

00:00:40.208 --> 00:00:43.041
Step and lift and your chest always stays forward.

00:00:42.083 --> 00:00:44.208
Good.

00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:45.250
Knees point in the same direction.

00:00:44.375 --> 00:00:46.250
Lift.

00:00:45.291 --> 00:00:47.041
Step and lift.

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:51.000
Make sure both knees are bent so you don't get this up and down trying to get the hip moving.

00:00:50.208 --> 00:00:52.541
Lift and step and lift.

00:00:51.583 --> 00:00:56.333
Double time.

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:58.666
Step.

00:00:57.833 --> 00:00:59.458
Lift.

00:00:58.750 --> 00:01:00.000
Step.

00:00:59.166 --> 00:01:00.750
Lift.

00:00:59.916 --> 00:01:01.375
Step.

00:01:00.791 --> 00:01:02.666
Lift.

00:01:01.708 --> 00:01:03.125
Step.

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:03.625
Lift.

00:01:02.666 --> 00:01:03.916
Good.

00:01:03.125 --> 00:01:05.916
Practice in front of a mirror make sure you're not bobbing up and down.

00:01:05.083 --> 00:01:08.208
Make sure your hands aren't doing something funny.

00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:10.250
You want nice clear lines.

00:01:09.291 --> 00:01:20.750
Excellent.
